all_6aef8a60401441279b71ae71"},{"content":"I have strong evidence that Richard Harmon plays John Murphy in \"The 100\" alongside his real-life sister Jessica Harmon (who plays Niylah, an unrelated character). Now I need to verify the other criteria: Murphy's marriages/children in the series, and Richard Harmon's height. Let me search for the character details and height.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"John Murphy The 100 Emori marriage children\", \"Richard Harmon height 5 feet 8 inches\", \"The 100 TV series seasons premiere 2014\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_689fd091fc3d458f9557c2e6","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"John Murphy The 100 character wife Emori married child\", \"Murphy The 100 Emori baby child survives series finale\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_a0e736faee0f4cf79c717210","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d65\"},\"ref\":\"d65\",\"snippet\":\" ... As tensions between Children of Gabriel and True Believers rise, Raven asks Murphy and Emori to use their status of Primes to try to calm everyone down which allows Wonkru to move Russell from his prison into the palace.\\n\\nIn False Gods, Raven seeks Emori's help as ... \",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d68\"},\"ref\":\"d68\",\"snippet\":\" ... John Chuldenko\\n\\nFollowing his divorce from first wife Judy Langford, Jack Carter married Elizabeth Brasfield, which made him the stepfather of her two children, John Chuldenko and Sarah Chuldenko Reynolds.\\n\\nJohn Chulde